<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Asignación Exitosa</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }
        .card {
            border: none;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card shadow-sm">
                    <div class="card-body text-center py-5">
                        <div class="mb-4">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-success" style="font-size: 5rem;"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="card-title mb-3">¡Asignación Exitosa!</h2>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted">
                            El profesor ha sido asignado correctamente al curso.
                        </p>
                        <div class="mt-4">
                            <a href="/paneles/administrador" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
                                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left me-2"></i> Volver al panel de administrador
                            </a>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>